{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/987416-2e-how-grants-vitriol","id":987416,"title":"[2E] How grants Vitriol?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Promethean: The Created"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-14T13:42:42-07:00","id":987416,"title":"[2E] How grants Vitriol?","content":"So I try to wrap my head how should I reward as ST Prometheans with Vitriol? <b>PtC</b> 2E points when resolving Milestones, but what about those gameplay related? Like should Created get Vitriol Beat for creating his first Disquite effect? What about starting to speak? Seeing someone in love?<br /> <br /> In nutshell - For what thing you would award Vitriol without making those things hard-coded Milestones of particular Created?<br /> <br /> In Mage it's simple - 'Oh, you see this new Mystery - Here is Arcane Beat' or like 'Oh, shiny new spell/Legacy/Artifact - Here is another Arcane Beat'. Corebook guidelines on granting Vitriol Beats are not clear for me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 10-14-2016, 05:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T10:44:45-07:00","id":988925,"title":"","content":"Vitriol gains are almost always from Milestone achievements (see page 105 for a summary). While there are some surface parallels to Arcane Beats and Experience, they are really very different beasts. As befits alchemy, Vitriol is a physical embodiment of spiritual progress. I would advise against awarding Vitriol on an ad hoc basis because it takes the focus off of the Pilgrimage.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Eric Christian Berg</b><br /> <i>Onyx Path Freelancer</i><br /> Promethean: The Created Second Edition, Dark Eras Companion","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2019-eberg","name":"eberg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2019_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"284"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T10:51:32-07:00","id":988929,"title":"","content":"If you wanted to take the focus off the Pilgrimage, though, what would be a good alternate method?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T12:15:02-07:00","id":988970,"title":"","content":"You could treat it like something akin to Practical Experience in Hunter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","name":"Caitiff Primogen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2507_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}